another Demon King?

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:07.200
Mistress, do you suppose she's just insane?

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:10.830
Rude! Rude! Rude!

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:15.080
So basically, there's now two Demon Kings?

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:18.410
That's right! So you have to defeat them!

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:20.040
That's awesome!

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:22.000
I want to see the new one!

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:24.370
What kind of animal is it, I wonder?

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:31.160
So that's the orc village, huh?

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:39.910
You wait here!

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:43.000
I can handle this myself!

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:50.870
Who the hell are you?

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:54.000
Do you know Animal Mask?

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.910
Animal Mask?

00:19:55.910 --> 00:19:58.410
You're playing dumb, huh?

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:07.370
He uses the same skills as Genzo?

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:09.080
Genzo?

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:11.580
That's right! Genzo Shibata!

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.950
Where is he?

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:18.700
Oh, dear. It seems our guest
is lacking in manners.

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:20.500
What do you want?

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:25.540
I want to defeat Genzo.
Tell me where he is!

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:27.870
And if I say no,

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:29.750
what will you do?

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:39.040
I don't see any demon beast hordes.

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:43.660
They said there were a ton of them,
so I skipped lunch.

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:45.540
Don't eat them!

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:49.200
I can smell that they passed this way, but...

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:54.330
The demon beasts were lucky
they didn't run into this pervert.

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:01.410
Genzo!

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:04.500
Perfect timing!

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:08.450
What's wrong?

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:10.370
The king...

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:14.000
What is this?

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.000
Mr. Orc King!

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:21.620
I failed in my attempt to defeat him.

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:23.620
What happened?

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:28.910
A man came leading a horde of demon beasts
and demanding to know where you were.

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:31.910
But the king didn't tell him.

00:21:31.910 --> 00:21:35.000
He's a true man! A man among men!

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:39.950
He was the one they called
the Demon King from another world!

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:16.330
I'm never leaving the house again.

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:18.790
The outside is dangerous!

00:23:18.790 --> 00:23:21.450
It's safest indoors!

00:23:22.620 --> 00:23:26.790
My bro turned into a shut-in!

00:23:28.750 --> 00:23:32.250
It's just not fair!

00:23:32.250 --> 00:23:36.750
Edgar, let's get revenge on that pervert!

00:23:38.250 --> 00:23:43.000
Yeah... I'm not the type to take
something like this lying down.

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:44.410
Let's do this!

00:23:45.750 --> 00:23:49.160
Next time: "Money x Bonds."
